Following on from the bounce problem: what is the minimum change that would make a bouncing variant possible?,Add a boolean bouncing flag to SnakeGame,"Change the hook so it receives the travel direction and can return more than a position - e.g. handleBoundary(Point rawNewHead, Direction direction) - and have SnakeGame remember the current direction between moves",Override performMove() in the bouncing subclass,Make handleBoundary() return a Board instead of a Point,,2,"The useful lesson: a template method's hook signature is a design commitment. It decides which future variants are cheap and which are impossible, and only the parent can widen it.",2

