Which of the following could a new SnakeGame subclass change WITHOUT touching SnakeGame itself? (select all that apply),What happens when the snake reaches the edge of the board,Whether a move ends the game by returning null from the boundary step,Whether self-collision ends the game,The order in which food handling and the collision check happen,Whether observers get notified after a move,"1,2","Only the boundary step is open. Collision, ordering and notification are all in the fixed part of the algorithm, which is precisely the guarantee the parent is making to every future variant.",2
